[{"id":"python-legacy-notes","type":"basic","priority":3,"deck":"Python","tags":["入门路线","旧笔记"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"Python(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/1480bf96/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(一)入门路线.md","articleTitle":"Python(一)入门路线","articlePath":"posts/1480bf96/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python 课程会删除或覆盖旧笔记吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不会。课程只吸收可复用的解释和练习，并重新核验过时或不准确的结论。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>旧笔记是输入材料，不是未经核验的事实来源；课程会保留有学习价值的部分，同时明确当前版本边界。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]